@host=https://tile-expert-test.local

### Manticore search: "example" matches *example* in the e-mail, name, hash, ...
GET {{host}}/api/orders?query=example
Accept: application/json

### Explicit wildcard: words starting with "test"
GET {{host}}/api/orders?query=test*
Accept: application/json

### Wildcard at the beginning: e-mails of a domain
GET {{host}}/api/orders?query=*@example.com
Accept: application/json

### Several words: all of them must match
GET {{host}}/api/orders?query=test example
Accept: application/json

### Search + grouping + date range
GET {{host}}/api/orders?query=example&group_by=month&start_day=2026-01-01&end_day=2026-12-31
Accept: application/json

### "*" (or an empty query) does not filter
GET {{host}}/api/orders?query=*
Accept: application/json

### Nothing found -> empty items
GET {{host}}/api/orders?query=nothingmatchesthis
Accept: application/json
